# Author & maintainer

**Christian Alberto** ([@christianalberto](https://github.com/christianalberto)) is the **author and maintainer** of this fork of GitHub Insights.

His work on this fork includes:

- Standalone cards
- 3D contribution profiles
- The UI / generator studio
- The **`alberto`** 3D contribution theme (`style=alberto`, AlbertoSettings palette)

